# Universal Exam Prompt — Agent Configuration for Cursor / Windsurf / Aider / Cline

## What This Repo Is

This is a universal skill hub for AI-powered exam preparation. It works for ANY university worldwide.

## How to Use

1. When the user asks an exam-related question, check the `AGENTS.md` file for available skills
2. Skills are in `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` — each is a complete instruction set
3. Load the relevant skill by reading its SKILL.md content
4. Follow the skill's instructions step-by-step to generate the best output

## Key Files

- `AGENTS.md` — Machine-readable registry of all available skills (XML format)
- `CLAUDE.md` — Quick reference table of all skills
- `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — Full skill instructions (the actual "brain")
- `USE-CASES.md` — 33 real-world workflow examples
- `CONTRIBUTING.md` — How to contribute sample papers and skills

